<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai police arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for operating a cross-border prostitution network, while Thai troops fired warning shots after fighting in Myanmar damaged twenty Thai homes. The government stripped the chief rabbi of citizenship as part of a broader foreigner crackdown, and Cambodian Prime Minister Manet publicly challenged overseas opposition over Thai reports on border farmland. Cambodia rejected Thailand's claim to a disputed border temple, and flash floods struck Phuket Island. The EU pledged $3.3 million for de-mining along the border, and a Chinese woman reported being abducted after an online dating scam in Thailand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Online Citizen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQTHlrYTFKVlc2VjZsOHIza1hIMlR5Q2hQc3NOeUliV1MxT1NJczBVNTl3aWtCQ3R2VEQ0UTJqbG0wbmVLWXdGVHV2a3lBRV91bVdKSjFQanJZelM3TVJQTElkX2NDd0Z3SlRnYUx3NU5qY2EySWZDVVJGbi1hRUlLTHhMRjc2NkUwVVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQeGdYeEs5MDlCMS1uUDNoTExFUDJpa3p0NHI3MVJHRmYzVWRzc3lNS2J3WUtEaTItMmZsc2xqNUxyVHZsZF95NER0enpULUtuYkZvVUwzWXZPa0NSQ1FnNUV6ME9Ld2tnVVU5elctX2Z4LWlLQXItc1VMNDZWR0JTN2JENExZV05LdzFtMVFuc3MwdzNJTFBsRG5sX2lYSnh2LVR0UkZSRXQwcE5pa1lsX3VQMEx1RUdjc1VZVDZZQlAyOFNU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOeHNlalhRSTJIVVBwbm1XZ21tR2ZJUDlTaS0wV3dySGluOXowVXlwM3VDcDBzVHcyZE9IRjJkY2ZweGt5dHdCX2NHTHNyWkFSRk9VR05uV1pDT2hKQ1VXZWZUaVZNdnlKZURoRzBMbnJCS2dxZ2xiZmpXdkdUMlJaa1RVNGpkaFRGN1V2OXdGX004eVRaWVJrakhPck5CdHdPeHYxZ3I3QTZjRXMtQ254Z3pSdHd4VWF6bFZ0eFM4enhFdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asia News Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPX3lka0taRFpHWXotemdEdDFPWUpPcVh